-- `Impact`) into these tables, with the same IDs (docs/impact-api-migration.md, phase 1). Nothing
-- reads them yet. "Max Impact Fund" (MIF) grants are Top Charities Fund (TCF) grants here; both
-- funds' grants share one table, and `legacy_id` keeps each grant's old ID (they overlapped).
--
-- The rows below are generated by `node scripts/impact-data.mjs generate` from the public API
-- (frozen since 2026-11-01) and are checked against it by `scripts/impact-data.mjs verify`.
-- Exchange_rates starts empty; POST /scheduled/exchange-rates fills it from the ECB.
--
-- Rollback: drop the seven tables (nothing else references them).

